From: Masahito S <firelzrd@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Feb 2026 10:10:52 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] sched: Import BORE 6.6.1 patch

Signed-off-by: hoang1007 <hoangvuhuy1007@gmail.com>
---
 include/linux/sched.h      |  34 +++
 include/linux/sched/bore.h |  39 ++++
 init/Kconfig               |  17 ++
 kernel/Kconfig.hz          |  17 ++
 kernel/exit.c              |   2 +-
 kernel/fork.c              |  11 +-
 kernel/futex.c             |   8 +
 kernel/sched/Makefile      |   1 +
 kernel/sched/bore.c        | 418 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 kernel/sched/core.c        |  12 ++
 kernel/sched/debug.c       |   2 +
 kernel/sched/fair.c        | 121 ++++++++++-
 kernel/sched/features.h    |   3 +
 kernel/sched/sched.h       |  10 +
 14 files changed, 682 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
